|GKB================================== Blur ==================================
|GKB=|XX0   Syntax: cblur                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0                                                                        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   This ability allows you to blur your movements and avoid hits        |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   while in combat. The effect can look quite impressive to any         |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   on-lookers lucky enough to watch your moves. You won't be able to    |GKB=
|GKB=|XX0   hit as often while you're concentrating on this effect.              |GKB=
|GKB==========================================================================
